### Istanbul University MIS Alumni API Test Collection (RFC 2616)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Root / Service Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Retrieve All Alumni Directory Records
GET {{baseUrl}}/alumni
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter Alumni by Graduation Year
GET {{baseUrl}}/alumni?year=2023
Accept: application/json

### 4. REST API: List All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### 5. REST API: Create New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_id": "130120010",
  "first_name": "Murat",
  "last_name": "Sahin",
  "email": "murat.sahin@ogr.iu.edu.tr",
  "role": "alumni",
  "graduation_year": 2023,
  "company": "Amazon",
  "job_title": "Solutions Architect"
}

### 6. REST API: Get User by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. OpenAPI JSON Specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
Accept: application/json
